    "steam_appid": 3765530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into the Epic Adventure of <i>Only Down: Into the Abyss</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey atop the heavens, in celestial heights. But here, your quest is not to stay\u2014but to descend. Why flee Paradise, you might ask? Because you're tired of serving the gods. Driven by a spirit of discovery, you set out to explore a world filled with traps and wonders, where every missed leap could cost you your life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Journey Through the Ages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of <i>Only Down</i> is rich and complex. The further you descend, the more the eras unfold, and the more realistic the graphics become. Each level offers unique challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paradise:</strong> Start in the gods\u2019 realm, bathed in divine light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Eras:</strong> Traverse Feudal Japan, Medieval Europe, the Wild West, and 20th-century skyscrapers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Military Base and Soviet Era:</strong> Approach modernity with immersive mechanics, including vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Darkness of Hell:</strong> End in a horrifying atmosphere where design and mechanics plunge into oppressive darkness.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes and Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beginning of the game, bright and classic, contrasts sharply with its original and unsettling conclusion. The horror mechanics of the final section subvert expectations, turning your progress into a true descent into hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every leap brings you closer to the unknown, every world pushes you to test your limits. From divine monotony to abyssal chaos, <i>Only Down: Into the Abyss</i> promises you an unforgettable adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend\u2026 if you dare.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into the Epic Adventure of <i>Only Down: Into the Abyss</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey atop the heavens, in celestial heights. But here, your quest is not to stay\u2014but to descend. Why flee Paradise, you might ask? Because you're tired of serving the gods. Driven by a spirit of discovery, you set out to explore a world filled with traps and wonders, where every missed leap could cost you your life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Journey Through the Ages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of <i>Only Down</i> is rich and complex. The further you descend, the more the eras unfold, and the more realistic the graphics become. Each level offers unique challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paradise:</strong> Start in the gods\u2019 realm, bathed in divine light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Eras:</strong> Traverse Feudal Japan, Medieval Europe, the Wild West, and 20th-century skyscrapers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Military Base and Soviet Era:</strong> Approach modernity with immersive mechanics, including vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Darkness of Hell:</strong> End in a horrifying atmosphere where design and mechanics plunge into oppressive darkness.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes and Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beginning of the game, bright and classic, contrasts sharply with its original and unsettling conclusion. The horror mechanics of the final section subvert expectations, turning your progress into a true descent into hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every leap brings you closer to the unknown, every world pushes you to test your limits. From divine monotony to abyssal chaos, <i>Only Down: Into the Abyss</i> promises you an unforgettable adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend\u2026 if you dare.</h2>",
    "short_description": "Only Down: Into the Abyss is an original parkour game, since one of the main mechanics of the game is to descend through the world, crossing time periods and the traps and puzzles that make it up.",
